have to harden the
containers end to end.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:13.090
And that can mean a lot of work.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:17.350
You can certainly harden your
containers through policies

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.550
and do the right thing.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:22.750
However, technically maintaining
